on top of all the special identification, teleport, and character
development commands in wizmode.  Newbies to the game won't have any
idea how to make good use of wishes anyway.  Even the wishing spoiler
won't help that much:  "You are blasted by Grayswandir's power!
DYWYPI?")
  



